vRAuWGiuKuowfv7VnIldBUenjJ-f2tAFVMy5i9P_z60W7EzwDfuTOV778B4&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRmM-LMA02T1fCu2qnuSomvgdWClaqrUZdqSXW3Pgubtw&oe=6B01D7B0"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Santa's Gift Tooss", "keywords": ["SantaClaus", "ChristmasVRgame", "Gifttossinggame", "Tossing", "throw"], "long_description": "Become Santa Claus: Transform into the legendary gift-giver in this enchanting VR experience on Meta Quest. Feel the magic as you take on Santa's role during Christmas Eve.\n\nDeliver Joy to every one: Your mission is to toss presents into chimneys, ensuring every one wakes up to the excitement of Christmas morning. Precision and timing are key to spreading holiday cheer!\n\nRide the Sleigh: Glide through snowy landscapes atop Santa\u2019s sleigh, pulled by faithful reindeer. Soar across rooftops, navigating through festive winter scenes that bring the holiday spirit to life.\n\nOvercome Challenges: Watch out for obstacles like blizzards and cheeky snowbirds that can disrupt your deliveries. Stay focused to ensure no child is left without a gift!\n\nEarn Points and Rewards: Every successful gift delivery earns you points. Aim for high scores as you master the art of Santa\u2019s gift toss and unlock festive surprises along the way.\n\nFestive Atmosphere: Immerse yourself in a world of dazzling visuals, cheerful holiday music, and intuitive VR controls, making this a magical.\n\nPerfect for Family Fun: Whether playing solo or sharing the joy with friends and family, Santa's Gift Toss is the ultimate holiday VR game to celebrate the Christmas spirit.", "short_description": "Santa's Gift Tooss is a delightful VR game on Meta Quest where you become Santa Claus. Your mission is to deliver gifts to every one by tossing presents into chimneys on Christmas Eve."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/privacypolicyforsantasgifttoos/trang-ch%E